PAXLOVID is indicated for the treatment of mild-to-moderate coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) in adults who are at high risk for progression to severe COVID-19, including hospitalization or death.[?2004hroot@b161fe3d96d1:/workspace# cat << 'EOF' > generate_answers.py
