[?2004l[?2004h>       "answer": "PAXLOVID (both nirmatrelvir and ritonavir tablets) must be co-administered together twice daily for 5 days, with or without food. The tablets must be swallowed whole and not chewed, broken, or crushed. Treatment should be initiated as soon as possible after COVID-19 diagnosis and within 5 days of symptom onset. If a dose is missed within 8 hours of the usual time, the patient should take it as soon as possible and resume the normal schedule. If missed by more than 8 hours, the missed dose should be skipped and the next dose taken at the regular time (do not double the dose).",
